{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟行政總裁薩蒂亞·納德拉近日在《務實工程師》播客中承認，微軟的應屆畢業生和初級崗位招聘已經放緩。他表示，公司當前的首要任務是把內部員工重新安排到更合適的位置，完成組織調整之後，才會考慮從外部招聘資深員工或應屆畢業生。納德拉稱，這段暫停期可能是為了建立新的軟件工程「工廠」，讓人類員工能夠在AI工具的輔助下獲得更高的產出。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588142.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.864062+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:06:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"d5bacd00be2affbf83dd7fb9153bc129ac3416c2d1fcb7186aa0cf34b9471026","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}